{
  "_readme": "Edit-mode profiles, keyed by GitHub login. This file only drives the in-browser UI; the edit-guard workflow enforces it server-side. Only admins may change it. 'person' links a login to the site's existing friend slugs (devin, jack, jon, julie, sawyer). permissions: path globs ('**' = everything, 'articles/**', 'journal.html', ...) or 'view' for read-only. save: 'direct' (commit straight to main) or 'pr' (branch + pull request). Keys in angle brackets are placeholders: replace them with the person's real GitHub login (logins can never contain < or >, so placeholders match nobody). Keys starting with '_' are ignored. 'characters' is informational (the site's own page names). Telorin's site page is titled just 'Telorin' (figures/telorin.html; there is no Telorin article and 'Nelis' does not appear on the site).",
